      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4C7400020C7740020B3C4C2DCC758002000100002FF000006C2A4D1A4C20D00100002FF000000C5D0C11C000A0032AC1CC7580020D654C11DC7440020D314ACE00020C788B2940020AC780020BD24AC70B4E0C694002E00100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "턱화석과 지느러미화석이었는데...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n문제는 둘 다 너무 좋아서\n도저히 고를 수가 없단 말이죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D131D654C11DACFC0020C9C0B290B7ECBBF8D654C11DC774C5C8B294B370002E002E002E00100001BE01000ABB38C81CB2940020B4580020B2E40020B108BB340020C88BC544C11C000AB3C4C800D7880020ACE0B97C0020C218AC000020C5C6B2E80020B9D0C774C8E0002E00100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 부탁이 있어요. 스톤숍에 가서\n마음에 드는 화석을 사 와 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
